      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اعفن</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a man) <i>had his skin,</i> or <i>hide,</i> or
<i>tanned skin</i> or <i>hide pierced with holes.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">??</span> <i>He found the flesh,</i> or <i>flesh-meat, to be</i> [<i>stinking,</i> or] <i>altered</i> [<i>for the worse</i>]
<i>in odour.</i> (Msb.)

